Hi,

What I do not understand yet is why we need a package like multimed if we can decompose a model with two causally dependent mediators (infant deprivation --> education level --> economic position --> aging well) into two models (infant deprivation --> education level --> aging well & education level --> economic position --> aging well).

I can not comment on this. Bit beyond my expertise.?

But if deprivation conditions education strongly, I could end not finding any direct nor indirect effect of education on aging well.

Yes, that may happen. The estimates will be biased if you exclude potential confounders.?

